get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/payments/return
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Public. The hosted checkout redirects the customer here after pay/cancel. Query params are **not trusted** — the order is re-verified via `getOrderStatus` before any state change. Returns a small HTML...
}
